

SendPS V2.0

Copyright (c) 1986 Adobe Systems Inc. All rights reserved.
This application is for down-loading POSTSCRIPT(R) files over AppleTalk.
Distributed without explicit support.

written by: Glenn Reid

This program is a Mac program, stored in MacBinary format.  Transfer it
to your Macintosh disk with Mac-2-Dos using the MacBinary conversion option.
Then use it on the Mac to send your PostScript files to the Mac printer.

To use this program on the Mac:
	1. Transfer SendPS to a Mac disk using Mac-2-Dos (MacBinary option)
	2. Load the Mac disk into a Macintosh
	3. Double-click on the SendPS icon
	4. Select Download PostScript File on the File menu
	5. Select the desired PostScript file from those displayed in the 
	   dialog-box (requester)

This program is provided only as a convenience for Mac-2-Dos users. 
Central Coast Software did not write this program, is not responsible for
its use, and cannot provide support for it.

